            "datePublished": "2024-09-24",
            "reviewBody": "Enjoyed 4 days 3 nights private group tour to Ijen and Mount Bromo!\\n\\nKudos to our tour guide Taufik who's friendly and did well to cater to our needs throughout the trip.\\n\\nWould also like to thank driver Nanang who drove us to every destination safe and sound :)",
