            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Desiree Lim"
            },
            "datePublished": "2024-04-28",
            "reviewBody": "Views of Ijen and Bromo are spectacular. Tour guide Taufik is humorous and very patient. He is so experienced and gives very good estimations of timings such that we caught all the pretty sceneries at the exact right timings. He also helps us along the way on the more difficult treks. Best tour guide! Driver Johan drives smoothly and fast. Your operator also replies very promptly. Good tour! Will recommend!! :)",
